# S27 (SKOS Reference 8.4): skos:related is disjoint with the
# property skos:broaderTransitive. This is the literal reading of
# the condition — it only works once skos:broaderTransitive has
# actually been materialized, e.g. by loading skos-axioms.ttl
# alongside the data and running the OWL-RL closure:
#
#   factoidal query --data DATA.ttl --data ../skos-axioms.ttl \
#     --entail owl-rl --query THIS.rq
#
# The OWL-RL closure (RDF.Graph.Executable.fst: rdfs7 for
# rdfs:subPropertyOf, prp-trp for owl:TransitiveProperty) derives
# skos:broaderTransitive generically from skos-axioms.ttl's
# declarations — no SKOS-specific engine code involved.
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
ASK {
  ?a skos:related ?b .
  ?a skos:broaderTransitive ?b .
}
